/* ============================================================
   Secret Suite — centralized catalog data
   ------------------------------------------------------------
   Single source of truth for the /secret-suite/ page. Presentation
   code (secret-suite.js) reads this array — no layout markup here.

   PRICING MODEL
   All prices are the vendor's own publicly listed self-serve rate as of
   PRICING_REVIEWED_DATE below (see pricingSourceUrl per row). Where a
   vendor only publishes an annual-billed rate, that is noted in
   pricingBillingNote and the monthly-equivalent figure is used. No
   promotional, discounted, or invented enterprise price is used.

   Team-size modeling (5-person business):
     - priceBasis "peruser": representativeMonthlyPrice x 5
     - priceBasis "perchannel"/"flat": counted once regardless of team size
     - priceBasis "merged": excluded from every total (duplicate of another row)

   Duplicate handling: SecretHelp (56) runs on the same Chatwoot instance as
   SecretSupport (16) and is excluded from the total as a true duplicate.
   SecretBookings/SecretSchedule, SecretInvoice/SecretMoney,
   SecretKnowledge/SecretWiki, and SecretVault/SecretDrive were reviewed and
   kept as distinct line items — each pair replaces a genuinely different
   paid product with its own pricing page (appointment scheduling vs.
   general calendar booking; invoicing vs. full-ledger accounting;
   customer-facing help docs vs. internal wiki; access-controlled sharing
   vs. general file sync). See duplicateNote per row.

   @typedef {Object} SecretSuiteApp
   @property {number} rank
   @property {string} secretName
   @property {string} slug
   @property {string} subdomain
   @property {string} description
   @property {string} category            - one of SS_SUITE_CATEGORIES
   @property {'available'|'beta'|'in_development'|'planned'} status
   @property {string} paidAlternative
   @property {string} logoSlug             - filename (no extension) in assets/competitor-logos/, or "" if no accurate free-licensed logo exists
   @property {string} logoFallbackReason   - set only when logoSlug is "" — why a text wordmark is used instead
   @property {number} representativeMonthlyPrice
   @property {'flat'|'peruser'|'perchannel'|'merged'} priceBasis
   @property {string} priceBasisNote
   @property {string} pricingSourceUrl     - vendor's own pricing page
   @property {string} pricingBillingNote   - true month-to-month vs annual-billed-equivalent, tier name
   @property {string} duplicateNote        - set when this row was reviewed against an overlapping row
   @property {string} openSourceFoundation
   @property {string} openSourceRepository - "owner/repo" shorthand, informational only
   @property {string} [openSourceUrl]      - full https URL for the "Source: X" secondary link shown next to the competitor block; omit to show no source link
   @property {string} [openSourceLabel]    - display label paired with openSourceUrl, e.g. "VoiceStudio"
   @property {string} operationalCostNote
   @property {string} licenseStatus
   @property {number} popularity
   ============================================================ */

